# BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile, so this applies to the insight-bot
# image only (signal-server's build is untouched). The context is the repo root.
# A CI checkout has none of these; a developer's worktree has all of them, and without this file a
# local build would ship every node_modules and the slot's .env (bot token, DB url) into the build
# stage and the local build cache.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.angular
**/*.tsbuildinfo
apps/insight-bot/public
.git
